		{"id":"0e2010ca6caa83f0","type":"text","text":"# git hooks abuse\n- git hooks directory contain scripts to execute like : post-commit, pre-commit etc\n- we created .git/hooks/post-commit with revshell code\n- make zip and put in `/home/jen/public/repos`\n- user jen will extract and will run hooks script `post-commit`","x":11400,"y":8680,"width":580,"height":220},
